    "updated_at": "2018-02-24T19:54:05Z",
    "body": "The alt attribute might be unique among the optional attributes in that it has historically been the focus of especial attention from accessibility guidelines and legal regulations. That’s presumably why the [section devoted to its semantics goes over them in extra detail](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/dev/images.html#alt). That attention from the outside plus the persistent confusion on how precisely to use it might warrant special editorial treatment, among the optional attributes. ",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
